    "faq": {
      "q1": "What is NAJAH?",
      "a1": "NAJAH is an Algerian educational platform for BAC students. It offers curated exercises from real exams, solutions from peers and verified teachers, and live study sessions.",
      "q2": "How do I sign up?",
      "a2": "Click \"Create account\" on the home page, enter your name, email, and a password, then follow the setup steps.",
      "q3": "Is NAJAH free?",
      "a3": "Yes, signing up and accessing most content is completely free. Some teacher sessions may have a small fee set by the teacher.",
      "q4": "How do I find exercises for my stream?",
      "a4": "After creating your account, choose your stream and preferred subjects during setup. Your feed will automatically show the most relevant exercises.",
      "q5": "How do I save an exercise to my library?",
      "a5": "Click the bookmark icon on any exercise card. You can access your saved exercises anytime from the Library section.",
      "q6": "How do I join a session?",
      "a6": "Browse the Sessions page, pick a session that suits you, and click Register. The meeting link will appear just before session time.",
      "q7": "Can I share my own solutions?",
      "a7": "Absolutely! Open any exercise and you'll find an option to add your solution. Share it with classmates and help them understand.",
      "q8": "Are AI hints reliable?",
      "a8": "AI-generated hints are an experimental learning tool. They may contain errors — always verify important information with your teacher.",
      "q9": "How do I change my password?",
      "a9": "Go to Settings → Password section, enter your current and new password, then click Update.",
      "q10": "How do I switch language?",
      "a10": "Click your name or the language menu in the navbar and choose your preferred language (Arabic, French, English).",
      "q11": "How do I delete my account?",
      "a11": "Go to Settings → Danger Zone and click Delete account. You'll be asked to confirm your email. This action cannot be undone.",
      "q12": "How do I report a problem?",
      "a12": "You can report any inappropriate content using the Report button on any post. For technical issues, use the contact form below."
    }
  },
